+// VirtualProtect ~70% of it, the per-page loop and the global critical region most of the rest). Pages
+// already watched are skipped by the original loop (the watch bit means "write-protected"), so only
+// unwatched pages are ever protected; what is left to save is the number of VirtualProtect calls and the
+// loop. Defined here (rexruntime) and read by the GPU plugin through REXCVAR_DECLARE.
