+      unwatch ? "unwatched, committed and guest-writable but not writable on the host (a guest "
+                "allocation/protection change in flight on another thread, or stale host protection); "
+                "the joined call makes it writable, as AccessViolationCallback's recovery path would on its "
+                "next guest write"
